{"overview":"وقتی یک خانواده رمانیاوی دیندار به شهرکی کوچک در نروژ نقل مکان می‌کند، دخترشان با کبودی‌های ناشناخته به مدرسه می‌آید و موضوعی برای رسوایی عمومی می‌شود. با ظهور اتهامات سوءاستفاده، آن‌ها در تحقیقی گرفتار می‌شوند که مرز بین نگرانی و پیش‌داوری را محو می‌کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"When a devout Romanian family resettles in a small Norwegian town, they become the subject of public scandal when their daughter shows up to school with unexplained bruises. As allegations of abuse emerge, they are swept up in an investigation that blurs the line between concern and prejudice.","tagline_en":"When does protection become control?","runtime":146,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Cristian Mungiu"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["RO","NO","FR"],"cast":[{"name":"سباستین استن","role":"Mihai Gheorghiu","photo":"/v20RLWst39klatsqUgSrwHxhwee.jpg","en":"Sebastian Stan"},{"name":"رناته رینس‌وه","role":"Lisbet Gheorghiu","photo":"/q0ljTd4fyFSJKxPgmcrKtdg3HKo.jpg","en":"Renate Reinsve"},{"name":"Lisa Carlehed","role":"Mia Halberg","photo":"/r6vxXVZfiTgOHumGRtPTQpXQtKz.jpg"},{"name":"Ellen Dorrit Petersen","role":"Gunda","photo":"/ynXvnMlMCCn0Uk6AOwRHLQRF9nZ.jpg"},{"name":"Lisa Loven Kongsli","role":"Frida","photo":"/pm5y6qrZqinsYZW0Rud1DjYU4mP.jpg"},{"name":"Henrikke Lund Olsen","role":"Noora Halberg","photo":"/1uGyDvAwm9uyhLtnXtPahhnUYHY.jpg"},{"name":"Markus Tønseth","role":"Mats Halberg","photo":"/ubDlfMGerK0RePOESlud0mpTpJu.jpg"},{"name":"Vanessa Ceban","role":"Elia Gheorghiu","photo":""},{"name":"Jonathan Ciprian Breazu","role":"Emmanuel Gheorghiu","photo":""},{"name":"Christian Rubeck","role":"Attorney Jacobsen","photo":"/gZ7f4zkmX8hluHkP6OCLpiofQNC.jpg"},{"name":"Øyvind Venstad Kjeksrud","role":"Åke","photo":"/gbokW1fpI189V7kKsDES1tHJqgr.jpg"},{"name":"Giulia Nahmany","role":"Ruth","photo":"/vHhT80PtKoO7nRQyzATh9GRvehZ.jpg"}],"trailer":"frg59VOungA","watch":{},"recs":[],"tmdb":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1401459"}